mindie-agent-dsh README · Introduction：- **`/mindie-agent` knowledge, skill, and experience loop entry** — on-demand access to `mindie_entry`, `knowledge_query`, `knowledge_explain`, `knowledge_distill`, `knowledge_feedback`, and `knowledge_sync` over `knowledge-vllm-ascend`, with an `L1`/`L2` foundation baseline, `L3` Hermes convergence, and `L4` RSI de-biased exploration loop, plus background `session.v4.jsonl.zstd` public-transcript redaction and community PR publication when contribution is enabled;
- **Remote development and local component tools** — `remote-dev` handles remote files, commands, and background jobs; `mindie-tools` provides local diagnostics, status checks, and access to `profiler`, `sim`, and `coordinator`. Both are available by default;
- **Ecosystem support** — `v0.1.14` (paired with `mindie-agent 0.1.12`) supports Claude Code ([`mindie-agent-cc`](https://github.com/mindie-agent/mindie-agent-cc)), OpenAI Codex CLI ([`mindie-agent-codex`](https://github.com/mindie-agent/mindie-agent-codex)), Kimi Code ([`mindie-agent-kimi`](https://github.com/mindie-agent/mindie-agent-kimi)), Google Antigravity ([`mindie-agent-agy`](https://github.com/mindie-agent/mindie-agent
